00:32:11,401 --> 00:32:16,740
Valmont and other manufacturers have produced about 400,000 pivots, now delivering life-giving

380
00:32:16,741 --> 00:32:19,300
water to more than 100 nations.

381
00:32:19,301 --> 00:32:26,920
They've left their signature circles from Brazil to Saudi Arabia.

382
00:32:26,921 --> 00:32:31,880
But in Nebraska, where pivots dominate the landscape like nowhere else, some experts

383
00:32:31,881 --> 00:32:36,760
