00:32:36,761 --> 00:32:41,700
The five trillion gallons pumped yearly from the Ogallala Aquifer far exceed the amount

385
00:32:41,701 --> 00:32:43,900
nature is able to replenish.

386
00:32:43,901 --> 00:32:53,500
There are a number of locations in Nebraska where the water table itself has been lowered by 30 or 40 vertical feet.

387
00:32:54,500 --> 00:32:57,160
And it is a worry to many people.

